{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"Blessed is|strong=\"H1732\"he|strong=\"H1732\"who considers the|strong=\"H1732\"poor.  \nThe|strong=\"H1732\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"will deliver him|strong=\"H1732\"in|strong=\"H1732\"the|strong=\"H1732\"day of|strong=\"H4210\"evil.   \n"},{"number":2,"text":"The|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"will|strong=\"H3068\"preserve|strong=\"H4422\"him|strong=\"H4422\", and|strong=\"H3068\"keep him|strong=\"H4422\"alive.  \nHe|strong=\"H3117\"shall|strong=\"H3068\"be|strong=\"H3068\"blessed on|strong=\"H3117\"the|strong=\"H3068\"earth,  \nand|strong=\"H3068\"he|strong=\"H3117\"will|strong=\"H3068\"not|strong=\"H7451\"surrender him|strong=\"H4422\"to|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"will|strong=\"H3068\"of|strong=\"H3068\"his|strong=\"H3068\"enemies.   \n"},{"number":3,"text":"The|strong=\"H5414\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"will|strong=\"H3068\"sustain him|strong=\"H5414\"on|strong=\"H3068\"his|strong=\"H5414\"sickbed,  \nand|strong=\"H3068\"restore him|strong=\"H5414\"from|strong=\"H5315\"his|strong=\"H5414\"bed of|strong=\"H3068\"illness.   \n"},{"number":4,"text":"I|strong=\"H5921\"said, “LORD|strong=\"H3068\", have|strong=\"H3068\"mercy|strong=\"H3068\"on|strong=\"H5921\"me|strong=\"H5921\"!  \nHeal|strong=\"H2015\"me|strong=\"H5921\", for|strong=\"H5921\"I|strong=\"H5921\"have|strong=\"H3068\"sinned against|strong=\"H5921\"you|strong=\"H3605\".”   \n"},{"number":5,"text":"My|strong=\"H3068\"enemies speak evil against|strong=\"H2398\"me|strong=\"H5315\":  \n“When|strong=\"H3588\"will|strong=\"H3068\"he|strong=\"H3588\"die, and|strong=\"H3068\"his|strong=\"H3068\"name perish?”   \n"},{"number":6,"text":"If he|strong=\"H8034\"comes to|strong=\"H4191\"see me|strong=\"H4191\", he|strong=\"H8034\"speaks falsehood.  \nHis|strong=\"H4191\"heart gathers iniquity to|strong=\"H4191\"itself.  \nWhen|strong=\"H4970\"he|strong=\"H8034\"goes abroad, he|strong=\"H8034\"tells it|strong=\"H8034\".   \n"},{"number":7,"text":"All|strong=\"H7200\"who|strong=\"H7723\"hate me|strong=\"H7200\"whisper together|strong=\"H6908\"against|strong=\"H1696\"me|strong=\"H7200\".  \nThey|strong=\"H2351\"imagine the|strong=\"H7200\"worst for|strong=\"H3318\"me|strong=\"H7200\".   \n"},{"number":8,"text":"“An|strong=\"H2803\"evil|strong=\"H7451\"disease”, they|strong=\"H5921\"say, “has|strong=\"H3605\"afflicted|strong=\"H5921\"him|strong=\"H5921\".  \nNow|strong=\"H5921\"that|strong=\"H3605\"he|strong=\"H3605\"lies he|strong=\"H3605\"shall|strong=\"H7451\"rise up|strong=\"H5921\"no|strong=\"H3605\"more|strong=\"H5921\".”   \n"},{"number":9,"text":"Yes, my|strong=\"H6965\"own familiar friend, in|strong=\"H1697\"whom I|strong=\"H1697\"trusted,  \nwho|strong=\"H3808\"ate bread with|strong=\"H1697\"me|strong=\"H3254\",  \nhas|strong=\"H1697\"lifted up|strong=\"H6965\"his|strong=\"H6965\"heel against|strong=\"H6965\"me|strong=\"H3254\".   \n"},{"number":10,"text":"But|strong=\"H1571\"you|strong=\"H5921\", LORD|strong=\"H3068\", have|strong=\"H1571\"mercy on|strong=\"H5921\"me|strong=\"H5921\", and|strong=\"H3899\"raise me|strong=\"H5921\"up|strong=\"H1431\",  \nthat|strong=\"H3899\"I|strong=\"H5921\"may|strong=\"H1571\"repay them|strong=\"H5921\".   \n"},{"number":11,"text":"By|strong=\"H3068\"this|strong=\"H3068\"I|strong=\"H6965\"know that|strong=\"H3068\"you|strong=\"H6965\"delight in|strong=\"H3068\"me|strong=\"H2603\",  \nbecause|strong=\"H3068\"my|strong=\"H3068\"enemy doesn’t triumph over|strong=\"H3068\"me|strong=\"H2603\".   \n"},{"number":12,"text":"As|strong=\"H3588\"for|strong=\"H3588\"me|strong=\"H5921\", you|strong=\"H3588\"uphold me|strong=\"H5921\"in|strong=\"H5921\"my|strong=\"H5921\"integrity,  \nand|strong=\"H3045\"set me|strong=\"H5921\"in|strong=\"H5921\"your|strong=\"H5921\"presence|strong=\"H5921\"forever.   \n"},{"number":13,"text":"Blessed be|strong=\"H5769\"the|strong=\"H6440\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\", the|strong=\"H6440\"God of|strong=\"H6440\"Israel,  \nfrom|strong=\"H6440\"everlasting|strong=\"H5769\"and|strong=\"H5769\"to|strong=\"H6440\"everlasting|strong=\"H5769\"!  \nAmen and|strong=\"H5769\"amen.   \n"}]}
